.TH ALI-ORACLE 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-oracle \- ask the oracle right now
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-oracle
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the current WORD plus today's verse from
.I /run/templeos-oracle .
The daemon consults on boot and hourly; this asks on demand.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-retro (1),
.BR oracle (8)
